# storybook static export
storybook-static/

# seeded design canvas (`docs/design/<topic>/`). The `design` skill's
# `seed-canvas.mjs` writes it — ~2.5 MB of inlined editor payload, regenerated
# on every change and never hand-edited — and names it after the design rather
# than a fixed name, so the extension is the only tell. The working artboards
# `<Name>.dc.html` stay tracked; git takes the LAST match, so negation last.
docs/design/**/*.html
!docs/design/**/*.dc.html

# AI
.claude/
.cursor/
settings.local.json
.gitnexus/
